  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Adjust pH to 7.0"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients except NaHCO3 and L-Cysteine·HCl·H2O. Bring to a boil and cool under CO2 gas stream, then add NaHCO3 and L-Cysteine·HCl·H2O to the medium. Dispense the medium into suitable culture vessels under a stream of CO2, seal with butyl rubber stoppers, and autoclave."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "To prepare the clarified rumen fluid, preheat rumen content at 120C for 15 min. Use the supernatant after centrifuging at 25,000 x g for 15 min."
    }
  ]
}